Pipe Opened [check box]
To open the entrance of the Pipe so that materials can flow through it, select this check box. To close the
Pipe, clear the check box.
Remarks
With an opened Pipe you can model a valve or a gate valve to open and to close the Pipe.
If you clear Pipe Opened, it shows the state Pipe Closed in cyan.
State vertical State horizontal
SimTalk
