Exit Strategy
Exit Strategy - Pipe
Select the Exit Strategy according to which the Pipe distributes the flow rate of the materials to the
succeeding fluid objects.
You can select one of these settings:
• Evenly distributed
• Percentage [Pipe]
Note
To show the items belonging to the new strategy, click Apply after you selected another strategy.
