Percentage [Pipe]
To distribute the flow rate of the Pipe according to a proportional distribution among the succeeding
fluid objects, select this setting.
Remarks
To show the button Open List, click Apply.
Open List
Click Open List and type in the percentages for the individual succeeding objects. In the example below
successor 1 receives 20% of the material, successor 2 receives 30%, etc.
Type 0 into the cell of the respective successor to prevent that successor from receiving any material.
If a successor cannot receive any material, because a succeeding Tank is full for example, the Pipe
distributes the portion of that successor of the flow rate according to the percentages to the remaining
successors.
The sum of the percentages does not have to add up to 100%. Instead, the actual sum of the percentages
of all successors, which can receive material, corresponds to a value of 100%. The percentages [40, 60],
[0.4, 0.6], and [2, 3] are equivalent for example.
SimTalk
